   "value": "<p><em>Boogie Woogie — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>Beginning at 6th level, “The act of applause is an acclamation of the soul”, you have gained a deeper understanding of your technique and how it can be used, your <em>Boogie</em> gains the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Your range increases to 45 feet.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The Cursed Energy cost is reduced by 1 Cursed Energy for all Boogie Woogie techniques (min cost of 1).  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can use <em>Boogie</em> once per turn as a free action for 1 cursed energy.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
